WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.550
(petals rustling)

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.133
(gentle music)

00:00:17.535 --> 00:00:20.118
(gentle music)

00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:25.710
(quirky music)

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.470
- [Announcer] Lake Naivasha, Kenya

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.730
could also be called rose heaven.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.900
The climate and fresh water
supply have allowed many to farm

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.297
some of the world's most coveted flowers.

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:38.710
The growers here work
extra hard to make sure

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.910
that the roses that end up in
bouquets all around the world

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.577
look perfect.
(quirky music)

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.830
- [Announcer] Whilst many
would be surprised to learn

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.220
that Kenya is a center for these flowers,

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.560
rose production has
flourished in the region

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.727
over the last few decades.

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:10.127
(quirky music)

